Package: TRM.RFF
Type: Package
Title: Nonlinear Threshold Regression with Random Fourier Features
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Wei",
      family = "Liu",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "liuweideng@gmail.com"
    )
  )
Description: Provides methods for estimation and inference in threshold
    regression models with nonlinear multivariate regime boundaries.
    Nonlinear regime boundaries are approximated using random Fourier
    features, enabling scalable estimation in settings with multiple
    threshold variables. The package implements smoothed first-stage
    boundary estimation, hard-regime regression refitting, and
    heteroskedasticity- and autocorrelation-consistent inference for
    structural regression coefficients. It also provides tools for
    simulation, regime classification, and model summarization.
Imports:
    stats,
    sandwich,
    future,
    future.apply
